===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁(y)-}}
First recorded in English 1852. Ultimately from {{der|en|la|fēminīnus}}, from {{m|la|fēmina|t=woman}}. See also {{m|en|feminine}}, {{m|en|feminism}}.

